+| `generateTokensTask(...)` | `AsyncStream<TokenGeneration>` | Yes | Yes | Raw token parsing with cleanup control |
+| `generateTokenTask(...)` | `AsyncStream<TokenGeneration>` | Yes | Yes | Low-level custom iterator pipelines |
 
